<title>USA: CSX Conrail file suit vs Norfolk.</title>
<headline>CSX Conrail file suit vs Norfolk.</headline>
<dateline>RICHMOND, Va. 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>CSX Corp. and Conrail Inc. said on Thursday they filed counterclaims in  U.S. District Court that alleged, among other things, that Norfolk Southern Corp. has interfered with their planned merger.</p>
<p>Norfolk Southern has launched a $110 per share all-cash bid worth $10 billion for Conrail, seeking to top an $8.6 billion friendly cash and stock deal between Conrail and CSX.</p>
<p>CSX and Conrail said their claims alleged Norfolk was not trying to acquire Conrail for $110 per share but to &quot;disrupt and cripple&quot; a strategic alliance between CSX and Conrail.</p>
</text>
